atlas surface
# The surface compiler and the learning organ above it. SurfaceIR consumes every
# app grammar + addressing + authority + evidence and compiles what an actor sees
# and can do; it renders affordances, it never authorizes. Its action traces feed
# Aurekai, which proposes better presentation/adjacency to the AddressPlane --
# closing the learning loop (riff SS10) without ever mutating semantic truth.

architecture surface-ir
  canonical_name SurfaceIR
  family surface
  domain Surface / Compilation
  layer surface
  semantic_question What should this actor see and be able to do, compiled from all relevant state?
  purpose The surface compiler. Consumes the nine app grammars plus addressing, authority and evidence, and emits a rendered surface and an action trace. It renders affordances; the exact Authority check still runs at effect time.
  maturity architectural
  owns SurfaceIR
  consumes DocType
  consumes SurfaceGrammar
  consumes DealState
  consumes TicketState
  consumes DerivedView
  consumes KnowledgeClaim
  consumes ShareGrant
  consumes RepresentationHistory
  consumes OpportunityEligibility
  consumes FortificationPlan
  consumes RouteAdvertisement
  consumes Authority
  publishes ActionTrace
  publishes SurfaceDelta
  forbidden_inference a surface renders an action -> the action is authorized (Authority gates at effect time; the surface only shows affordances)
  forbidden_inference a fact is off-surface -> the fact does not exist (a surface is a projection, not the fabric)
  source_lineage frontend fold -- surfaces as projections over shared semantic objects
  known_gap the surface compiler is architectural; it names the grammars it fuses, not yet a running renderer

architecture aurekai
  canonical_name Aurekai
  family surface
  domain Surface / Learning
  layer learning
  semantic_question Which presentation and adjacency motifs recur, and what better candidates should be proposed?
  purpose Learns from action traces and proposes surface candidates and SID-locality to the AddressPlane. It proposes; it never changes deterministic semantic truth.
  maturity architectural
  consumes ActionTrace
  publishes SurfaceCandidate
  forbidden_inference a learned pattern -> changed semantic truth (Aurekai proposes; the fabric stays authoritative)
  forbidden_inference a frequent motif -> a correct or authorized one (frequency is not correctness; the fence and Authority still run)
  source_lineage frontend fold -- variation/pattern/promotion above the deterministic fabric
  known_gap the learning organ is architectural; the trace->candidate loop is specified, not yet trained
